{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13299","headline":"送魏六侍御葬 · 皇甫冉","name":"送魏六侍御葬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"哭葬寒郊外，行将何所从。\n盛曹徒列柏，新墓已栽松。\n海月同千古，江云覆几重。\n旧书曾谏猎，遗草议登封。\n畴昔轻三事，尝期老一峯。\n门临商岭道，窗引洛城钟。\n应积泉中恨，无因世上逢。\n招寻偏见厚，疎慢亦相容。\n张范唯通梦，求羊永绝踪。\n谁知长卿疾，歌赋不还邛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}